   1:simpleserial-chacha20.c **** /*
   2:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****     SimpleSerial ChaCha20 target, based on simpleserial-base.
   3:simpleserial-chacha20.c **** 
   4:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****     Commands (SimpleSerial 1.1):
   5:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****       'k' 32 bytes : set 256-bit key
   6:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****       'n' 16 bytes : set counter (4 bytes, little endian) || nonce (12 bytes)
   7:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****       'p' 16 bytes : encrypt 16 bytes of plaintext with the first 16 bytes
   8:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****                      of the keystream block -> returns 'r' with 16 bytes
   9:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****       'x'  0 bytes : reset key/nonce/counter to zero
  10:simpleserial-chacha20.c **** 
  11:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****     The trigger is high for the full ChaCha20XOR() call (state setup,
  12:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****     20 rounds, XOR). ChaCha20 itself is taken from
  13:simpleserial-chacha20.c ****     https://github.com/shiffthq/chacha20/tree/master (see chacha20.c).
  14:simpleserial-chacha20.c **** */
